<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN AMRO no comment on CU bid talk.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO no comment on CU bid talk.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch bank ABN AMRO NV said on Tuesday it had no comment on speculation that it would bid for British insurer, Commercial Union Plc (CU).</p>
<p>&quot;Our official comment is that we don't comment on market rumours,&quot; ANB AMRO spokesman Theo van Dijk told Reuters.</p>
<p>Commercial Union shares have risen 13 percent in the last week on rumours and newspaper reports suggesting it could face a takeover offer from a continental European bank or insurer.</p>
<p>There was talk ABN AMRO could be interested in Commercial Union's Dutch unit, Delta Lloyd.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
